; Reader and writer of a plain-file project-tracking data repository, in the data
; format of the `wl` worklog tool (see docs/worklog-format.md). Library only.
;
; flock_stubs.c: `wl` serialises its writers with a BSD flock(2) on .wl.lock, and
; Linux keeps flock and POSIX record locks (Unix.lockf) apart, so the same lock
; needs this one-function binding for the two tools to exclude each other.

(library
 (name mesh_worklog)
 (public_name session_mesh.worklog)
 (libraries unix yojson)
 (foreign_stubs
  (language c)
  (names flock_stubs)
  (flags :standard -Wall -Wextra)))
